{"id":"aimable","lemma":"aimable","pos":"adj","rank":2574,"glosses":["likeable, amiable"],"ipa":"/ɛ.mabl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/Fr-aimable.ogg/Fr-aimable.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"aimables"},"formAudio":{"aimables":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-aimables.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Merci pour vos aimables paroles.","en":"Thank you for your kind words.","words":[{"g":"thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null,{"g":"lyrics, words"}]},{"text":"Tu es très aimable.","en":"You're very kind.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Vous êtes aimable de le dire.","en":"You're kind to say so.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to say, to tell"}]},{"text":"Les étudiants de cette école sont aimables.","en":"The students of this school are kind.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"studying","l":"étudiant"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"C'est très aimable à vous.","en":"That's very kind of you.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"you"}]}]}